        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="right-summary" value="&#8226; All threads in a block cooperatively execute one task.&lt;br&gt;&#8226; Programmers write each task as a block-parallel CUDA program.&lt;br&gt;&#8226; Inter-task warp divergence does not occur." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=50;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1C2D3C;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
